{
  "schemaVersion": "1",
  "description": "Canonical publication metadata for the surfaced pre-06 FireMUD platform settings domains. Spring metadata remains the source for key names, descriptions, defaults, and enum hints; this file adds publication-specific ownership and UX fields so one generated JSON schema and Markdown reference can serve operator/admin consumers.",
